## Objective
Apply consistent visual attributes and animations across the entire portfolio website to increase cohesiveness and visual appeal.

## Current State
The main `index.html` has good styling with modular CSS (`variables.css`, `base.css`, `layout.css`, `components.css`, `animations.css`, `responsive.css`), but project pages like `projects/trade-compliance/demo.html` and `projects/trade-compliance/documentation.html` have inline styles that don't fully align with the main design system.

## Required Changes

### 1. Unified CSS Variables Usage
- Ensure all pages use the design tokens from `css/variables.css`
- Apply consistent color scheme: `--bg-primary: #121212`, `--bg-secondary: #1E1E1E`, `--accent-primary: #A0A0A0`
- Use consistent spacing scale (`--space-xs` through `--space-2xl`)
- Apply consistent border radius (`--radius-sm`, `--radius-md`, `--radius-lg`)

### 2. Enhanced Animations in `css/animations.css`
Add the following animations for increased visual appeal:

```css
/* Staggered fade-in for grid items */
.skills-grid .card:nth-child(1) { transition-delay: 0.1s; }
.skills-grid .card:nth-child(2) { transition-delay: 0.2s; }
.skills-grid .card:nth-child(3) { transition-delay: 0.3s; }
.skills-grid .card:nth-child(4) { transition-delay: 0.4s; }

/* Similar stagger for other grids */
.news-grid .card:nth-child(1),
.projects-grid .card:nth-child(1),
.experience-grid .card:nth-child(1) { transition-delay: 0.1s; }
/* ... continue pattern */

/* Smooth scale on hover for cards */
.card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px) scale(1.02);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
}

/* Glow effect for buttons */
.btn:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(160, 160, 160, 0.3);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
}

/* Text reveal animation */
@keyframes textReveal {
    from {
        opacity: 0;
        clip-path: inset(0 100% 0 0);
    }
    to {
        opacity: 1;
        clip-path: inset(0 0 0 0);
    }
}

.header-content h1 {
    animation: textReveal 1s ease forwards;
}

.header-content .subtitle {
    animation: textReveal 1s ease 0.3s forwards;
    opacity: 0;
}

.header-content .tagline {
    animation: textReveal 1s ease 0.6s forwards;
    opacity: 0;
}

/* Smooth section transitions */
section {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
    transition: opacity 0.8s ease, transform 0.8s ease;
}

section.visible {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
}

/* Floating animation for decorative elements */
@keyframes float {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
}

/* Shimmer effect for loading states */
@keyframes shimmer {
    0% { background-position: -200% 0; }
    100% { background-position: 200% 0; }
}

/* Progress bar fill animation */
.progress-bar {
    width: 0;
    transition: width 1s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
}

/* Glassmorphism enhancement */
.card, header, .glass {
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
}
```

### 3. Update Project Pages
Refactor `projects/trade-compliance/demo.html` and `projects/trade-compliance/documentation.html`:
- Link to the main CSS files instead of inline styles
- Add animation classes (`fade-in`, `visible` triggers)
- Include the main JavaScript files for scroll animations
- Apply consistent card styling with glassmorphism effects

### 4. Add Smooth Scroll Behavior
In `css/base.css`, ensure:
```css
html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
}
```

### 5. Enhanced Hover Microinteractions
Update `css/components.css` with:
```css
/* Enhanced card hover */
.card {
    transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1), 
                box-shadow 0.3s ease,
                border-color 0.3s ease;
}

.card:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent-primary);
}

/* Button microinteractions */
.btn {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
}

.btn::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    transition: width 0.6s ease, height 0.6s ease;
}

.btn:hover::before {
    width: 300%;
    height: 300%;
}

/* Link hover effects */
a {
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
}
```

### 6. Section Visibility Observer
Update `js/scroll.js` to also observe sections:
```javascript
// Add sections to the observer
const sections = document.querySelectorAll('section');
sections.forEach(section => observer.observe(section));
```

## Expected Outcome
- All pages share the same visual language and design tokens
- Smooth, professional animations throughout the site
- Staggered animations create a polished, dynamic feel
- Hover states provide feedback and interactivity
- Glassmorphism effects create depth and modern aesthetic
- The website feels cohesive and visually unified

</details>

